			<div class="content" id="post-content-2425335">
									

<p>Firstly, allow me to thank those who looked through such as DreamwalkerFae and CumaeanSibyl.</p>
<p>This article features the following:</p>
<ul>
<li>SCP-2748 (Driving Roadkill from Xiangxi) by MrWrong</li>
<li>SCP-2669 (Khevtuul 1) by Kalinin</li>
<li>Project Heimdall compiled by Hornby</li>
</ul>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
