<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>This SCP is many things&#8230; my conception of a half-ghost SCP which turned out like this. The real anomalies are the jade suit and it tying the hun (ethereal soul) to the body. Ergo, the jade suit worked too well.</p>
<p>About the &quot;into himself&quot; aspect, I won't take it at face value. 2372-A is likely to be asserting himself all the way to get his goal (get out of the body he's stuck in).</p>
